title: PPS Self-Defence
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: polish_party_system and pps_militia_timer <= 0
card-image: img/protest.jpg
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; pps_militia_timer += 6; pps_militia_training_cost = 2 if pps_militia_militancy > 0.1 else pps_militia_training_cost = 1; pps_militia_training_cost = 3 if pps_militia_militancy > 0.25
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Paramilitary organizing in defense of the republic.

= [+ pps_militia_name +]

The *Milicja PPS* protects party meetings, offices, demonstrations and strikes. Its strength is the approximate number of active, organized members available for party self-defence. Trade unions may cooperate with it, but their members are not automatically counted as militia manpower.

[? if pps_militia_stage == 2 : Reorganized as *Akcja Socjalistyczna*, it has a more systematic structure for socialist self-defence. ?]

- @militant: Fund additional organization, training and equipment.
- @militant_2: Use existing organizational funding for more training.
- @union_cooperation
- @reorganize_as
- @same: Keep the organization as it is.
- @cut_rb: Cut funding for party self-defence.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

#- Orient reichsbanner towards anti-fascism (only available if we have prioritized anti fascism)

@militant
choose-if: resources >= pps_militia_training_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ pps_militia_training_cost +] needed).
subtitle: -[+ pps_militia_training_cost +] resources
on-arrival: resources -= pps_militia_training_cost; pps_militia_investment += 1; pps_militia_strength += 100; pps_militia_militancy += 0.05; lewica_strength += 2; lewica_dissent -= 2; centrum_dissent += 5; spd_militancy += 0.05; workers_pps += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_pps += 2*(1-dissent)

Better organization and training improve our ability to defend socialist activity against nationalist militias, communist militias and hostile state police. Lewica approves, while Centrum is concerned about uncontrolled militarization.


@militant_2
view-if: funded_pps_militia >= 1
on-arrival: pps_militia_militancy += 0.02; funded_pps_militia -= 1

Existing organizational funding is redirected toward training and readiness.

@union_cooperation
title: Establish cooperation with the socialist trade unions.
view-if: pps_militia_union_cooperation == 0
on-arrival: pps_militia_union_cooperation = 1; pps_militia_militancy += 0.02; labor_dissent -= 2
max-visits: 1

The militia and affiliated unions establish procedures for protecting rallies and strikes. This improves coordination, but union members are not added to militia strength.

@reorganize_as
title: Reorganize the Milicja PPS into Akcja Socjalistyczna.
view-if: pps_militia_stage == 1
on-arrival: pps_militia_stage = 2; pps_militia_name = "Akcja Socjalistyczna"; akcja_socjalistyczna_formed = 1; pps_militia_militancy += 0.10
max-visits: 1

The Milicja PPS is reorganized into **Akcja Socjalistyczna**. Its membership remains the same, but clearer organization and preparation increase its militancy.


@same

The present defensive organization remains unchanged.

- @return: Continue...


@cut_rb
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: resources += 1; pps_militia_strength -= 100; pps_militia_militancy -= 0.05; lewica_strength -= 2; lewica_dissent -= 2; spd_militancy -= 0.05; workers_kpp += 2; unemployed_kpp += 2

Cutting resources reduces the number of active members and their readiness. Some workers instead turn toward communist organizations.
